{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50500","headline":"早春泛镜湖 · 宋之问","name":"早春泛镜湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漾舟喜湖广，湖广趣非一。\n愉目野载芜，清心山更出。\n孤烟昼藏火，薄暮朝开日。\n但爱春光迟，不觉舟行疾。\n归雁空间尽，流莺花际失。\n远情自此多，景霁风物和。\n芦人收晚钓，棹女弄春歌。\n野外寒事少，湖间芳意多。\n杂花因烂熳，暄柳日逶迤。\n爲客顿逢此，於思柰若何？\n（此诗见《永乐大典》卷二二六七「六模」「湖」字「镜湖」条。\n〖二函二十册〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50500.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50500","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}